 ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Kingdom of Peace</strong> is the story of a man facing the cruelty of war and trying to build a future in a world full of challenges. Will Rac\u0142aw find peace and a place to call home? <strong>See for yourself ;)</strong></p>",
